@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@orderId = 72391
@orderNumber = P010773

### Entrada inicial de la vista Pedidos (detalle directo, sin búsqueda ni COUNT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/by-number/{{orderNumber}}

### Buscar el pedido de captura
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders?q=P010773&page=1&pageSize=25

### Buscador visual: todos los criterios son opcionales y combinables
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders?orderNumber=P010773&customerOrderNumber=9063&customerCode=000033&orderedAt=2021-05-05&dueAt=2021-05-05&status=SURT&branch=0&warehouse=01&minimumFulfillmentPercentage=0&page=1&pageSize=100

### Botón Pedidos O.K.
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders?authorization=O.K.&page=1&pageSize=100

### Cargar pantalla Pedidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}

### Navegación inferior
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/previous

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/next

### Acciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/assign-all
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/authorize
### Auxiliar
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/auxiliar
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/boxes
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/classifications
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/comments
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/quote-conversion
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/duplicate
