###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/secondary-actions/wip

### Crear pedido desechable (cambie número, cliente y producto antes de ejecutar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "PAPI0001",
  "customerId": 15363,
  "customerOrderNumber": "PRUEBA API",
  "orderedAt": "2026-08-26",
  "from": "2026-08-26",
  "dueAt": "2026-08-26",
  "warehouse": "01",
  "currencyId": 1,
  "lines": [{ "productId": 10590, "quantity": 1, "price": 1, "discount": 0 }]
}

### Editar
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "observations": "PRUEBA CONTROLADA" }

### Eliminar (solo pedido desechable no surtido y sin factura)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}
